What is my wish for today? Or you might think, what is my wish for the next four weeks? Or what do I want in life? What is it really that I want? So you can whoop, very big wishes, or you can whoop, trivial wishes. But what is important, it needs to be a wish which is dear to your heart. And the nice thing with whoop is that it also allows you to finally think about what do I really want.
我今天的愿望是什么？或者你可能会想，我接下来四周的愿望是什么？或者我在生活中想要什么？我真正想要的是什么？所以你可以对非常宏大的愿望进行WHOOP，或者你可以对琐碎的愿望进行WHOOP。但重要的是，它需要是一个你内心里珍视的愿望。WHOOP的好处在于，它还允许你最终思考：我到底想要什么？

